/E (Davide Danovi is Co Founder and CSO of Migration Biotherapeutics. The company develops a decoy conduit technology targeting migrating glioblastoma cells to address tumour recurrence. He also works as an independent partner with Hoya Consulting, based in Stockholm.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [5]
>>
