/E (Araceli Biosciences, based in Portland, Oregon, is on a mission to transform therapeutic discovery with technologies built for speed, precision, and impact. Our advanced High Content Imaging platforms deliver real-time analysis, providing researchers with immediate, actionable answers during experiments. This ability to respond at the pace of biology accelerates decision-making, improves candidate selection, and reduces costly downstream failures.)
